    Basque — TO BE TRANSLATED.

    Every string below still holds its English text: this file is a starting
    point, not a translation. Translate the contents of the tags, never their
    `name` attribute, and read CONTRIBUTING.md first — placeholders keep their
    number, plurals keep the categories of this language, and apostrophes are
    escaped.

    While a string is left in English, that is what this language's users will
    read. The application's default language is English, in `values/`, which is
    what this file was copied from.
-->
